{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLBend"}],"title":"MXLBend","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The bend type is used in guitar notation and tablature. A single note with a bend and release will contain two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bend elements: the first to represent the bend and the second to represent the release. The shape attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguishes between the angled bend symbols commonly used in standard notation and the curved bend symbols"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commonly used in both tablature and standard notation."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLBend"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlbend"}}}